{"version":1,"content":"<p>埃隆·馬斯克已向新成立的媒體公司Skydance（天空之舞）投資約10億美元。這筆投資消息傳出之際，距離派拉蒙完成對華納兄弟探索公司的1100億美元收購僅過去數周。此次交易促成了兩大傳媒集團的整合，並組建了新的Skydance公司。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1583424.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:59:37.638494+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:49:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_hash":"ced84e4bad596489f86363824afccf5d629b7bb3bc0211a19b0ec4b27903e801","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}